@startuml
title 1024-bit CPU Datapath (Skeleton)

actor "Program" as Prog

component "Instruction Memory / Opcode Stream\nmemory[]" as IM
component "PC Register\npc" as PC
component "Decoder (Placeholder)" as DEC
component "ALU (1024-bit helpers)" as ALU
component "Register File\nregfile[16]\n(16x64 limbs each)" as RF

Prog --> IM : fetch qword opcode
PC --> IM : pc index
IM --> DEC : opcode
DEC --> ALU : op + dst/src/imm
ALU --> RF : read operands / write results
DEC --> PC : update pc (pc+1 or branch)

note right of ALU
Implemented helpers (so far):
- mov
- add
- sub
- eq compare
- imm64 load
end note
@enduml

